#: scenario2:scenario2_0816F8A8_8018_45FF_9B57_AFFB54B576ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 089c671fd3e443d8105d5e89aac789bf3d085d4716ce56dc98e8bb7202c49f0e
#. default-sha256: c11fdc6217b66a519b3093899b096335802265bfa6d28f7dd267acdc37e5d2ae
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0816F8A8_8018_45FF_9B57_AFFB54B576ED"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫⟪k:39⟫“The mansion sat in ruins in that era; not a soul resided "
"within.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫⟪k:39⟫Le manoir était à l’abandon à cette époque-là ; pas une âme "
"n’y résidait."

#: scenario2:scenario2_7CFDEB4E_A156_46FB_89AF_CD8E115FF7DE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9956835b9f4a748d02db945b4620b0776d9e9a244185dd4b06f018ab37e00d71
#. default-sha256: 367b130bc79a82e14a9ac80f2c2fd4439aaa4ab14a84baa15de812da3776de01
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7CFDEB4E_A156_46FB_89AF_CD8E115FF7DE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The grandeur of the house was lost to the ages. It was in perpetual decline."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫La splendeur de la maison était révolue depuis longtemps. Elle était en perpétuel "
"déclin."

#: scenario2:scenario2_20224EB1_F2D4_47F8_AC9D_6A5486C7D60C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 79cdd8fc7028fb560d618ae78fa2ad509897e1c713cdf0a5ccf2474fad54719b
#. default-sha256: ad498657588f0aaeefccd8bc50fcde1d2ee2ee329895161135d2f78cf6d898e7
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_20224EB1_F2D4_47F8_AC9D_6A5486C7D60C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not a flower grew in the garden; dust and dirt blackened the plaster; cobwebs blanketed the "
"corridors; ivy shrouded the outer walls. It was not a pleasant sight."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pas une seule fleur ne poussait dans le jardin ; la poussière et la saleté noircissaient le "
"plâtre ; des toiles d’araignée envahissaient les couloirs ; du lierre recouvrait les murs "
"extérieurs. Ce n’était pas beau à voir."

#: scenario2:scenario2_7342F8BC_F997_4864_8E42_6708128E6634
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7a42e1881e5cd20d07cc16e8b18a09da221f591056b8bbb0436de3d56cadae31
#. default-sha256: 9213cca85a3b384aee80a4640223d7dddb824fe5f1824f5cc6a09a9aa9af5873
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7342F8BC_F997_4864_8E42_6708128E6634"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫As hard as I tried to fight it, I could not stop the mansion’s descent into disrepair."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫J’avais beau me démener, je n’arrivais pas à enrayer cette lente dégradation."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A83B6CDB_837C_4075_B36A_BA8BA5F49E84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe9e87f78be22eca0e07274c2382ef876441aa91e845775aa2439d38c6b297b9
#. default-sha256: d58c17f30883955070abd03afa6081c06e8afaccc125e68fb3f56985cf1b2385
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A83B6CDB_837C_4075_B36A_BA8BA5F49E84"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The depth of the previous owner’s grief—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫or perhaps despair—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫was far too "
"much."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La douleur du précédent propriétaire —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ ou plutôt son désespoir —⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ prenait "
"racine dans la maison."

#: scenario2:scenario2_DDB7499B_52CF_4FD8_9D43_879A54A198F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb154ecf02b25037004d89dabaeaa2f1e1d4265fd27e80509e73c44faba02038
#. default-sha256: 93de718e4b3e2b8807907c1c2935d7eee208fb5e161a48be4cf6620a889c4cd1
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_DDB7499B_52CF_4FD8_9D43_879A54A198F3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫After the beautiful, flaxen-haired family, people stayed away from the mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Après la belle famille aux cheveux blonds, les gens évitèrent le manoir."

#: scenario2:scenario2_5B7D8B0A_B2BC_4EDE_BB71_1858CF8F3492
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2ae8c5cb1f2b8ea7337f362930342924e364a84a859a61493e731fb94f18f4e4
#. default-sha256: 0154e7fb14cbb01a799039dfc473ba22c6980cf27ac535345b01f0e648ef0b05
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_5B7D8B0A_B2BC_4EDE_BB71_1858CF8F3492"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They had no heirs, so their bloodline simply vanished into the depths of history."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ils n’eurent pas d’héritier, donc leur lignée disparut simplement dans les limbes de "
"l’histoire."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C32C96B2_91D2_4468_888D_DAFD14F4F1E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5b7cc58b7ac3e116d43c64623eeb70f8716bcc902094caf3ca80e62b4dcbc3cf
#. default-sha256: 7f32e63eaff47507616b79ee4237b2ac5574c9e83d46fac88ba5536ca361d495
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C32C96B2_91D2_4468_888D_DAFD14F4F1E4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It had been about fifty years since the house last had a resident."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫La maison n’avait eu aucun résident depuis environ cinquante ans."

#: scenario2:scenario2_EC9547D8_3420_40FC_A5C2_6710453F891D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1d56b29561914ba0a76ce84a0761b5260adcbc4c51a773bd8112ceab72fe4c7c
#. default-sha256: d7408946512edd1a78fa2fabbec29406877820016044585fcf79dc3bc2963b6e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_EC9547D8_3420_40FC_A5C2_6710453F891D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The forlorn property appeared as though it had been abandoned for centuries, and the "
"occasional villager who stumbled upon it did not remain there for more than a day."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫On eût dit que la propriété à l’abandon avait été désertée depuis des siècles ; de temps en "
"temps, un villageois y arrivait par hasard mais ne restait pas plus d’une journée."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D9A1BB5C_BFAA_4114_84FC_B8B5D6C46B51
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a5573846d06bbf703c811d03de95f2947676d02eb76001a6ee60452af63064da
#. default-sha256: 344d22e2656f594f3883d7f440eacae89d0e8827bfd6afbb8aac5ca41f821e74
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D9A1BB5C_BFAA_4114_84FC_B8B5D6C46B51"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫My time there was rather solitary. ⟪k:1⟫That was perhaps the loneliest time of my life."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je me retrouvai donc esseulée. ⟪k:1⟫Ce fut sans doute l’époque où je souffris le plus de la "
"solitude."

#: scenario2:scenario2_9AF8CEF9_75EC_4664_93E5_597CF93FECD9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f05185341fb2459399e3439fe8354b767ecb055cb50f172ca6d69766f7369aac
#. default-sha256: df9a67a75f52bbc09ef1056e035261f1323bdb6aa3a534ba52036e4eeebd1cc0
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_9AF8CEF9_75EC_4664_93E5_597CF93FECD9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Everyone who visited the mansion feared it, and it was left without anyone to become its "
"master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Tous ceux qui visitaient le manoir en avaient peur, donc il restait sans maître."

#: scenario2:scenario2_CE132600_052B_42F7_B729_A003A144D404
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 444cc71ed1fb72d9c78a5430e17f641a91bd41870edc89c41a6e382807a6483b
#. default-sha256: af0a4d3e15783644455b961ff163a4c42ee3010f1922c3afda9bd207fcbf574c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CE132600_052B_42F7_B729_A003A144D404"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I even came to believe that my time serving as a maid would come to an end in this era."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫J’en étais même venue à croire que mes années de service prendraient désormais fin."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E25C3AE2_1984_4498_A8D3_6FC852CBAB9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f83cdeb5c91268e8c30156738eac4c74380315f6669f161ddebb753c1c4306cc
#. default-sha256: 2b45f8d7173a5e38a2a536488b54535e7ba5ea62785406d65902e015cb0b0632
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E25C3AE2_1984_4498_A8D3_6FC852CBAB9B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫However, one day, I noticed something out of the ordinary."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Cependant, un jour, je remarquai quelque chose qui sortait de l’ordinaire."

#: scenario2:scenario2_7214E523_D877_4548_937E_86CE27BDB472
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 288fdeb7efbe98a53c2f9af7bcfa9ea7e93531299fade2a45da9902bbaea1fef
#. default-sha256: 23cd287dfe3b9fbb79c83a0d71d9db270c532a8c09d291a06212975bdf1d10ac
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7214E523_D877_4548_937E_86CE27BDB472"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As a servant of the house, I am almost immediately aware of any new presence within its "
"walls."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫En tant que servante de la maison, je ressens presque immédiatement toute nouvelle présence "
"entre ces murs."

#: scenario2:scenario2_6F1BFE48_A06D_46EC_A469_FF0B76D4CD9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 83d8436b67b0d3adcc331c6b994fd3a7289557c1283c4c6bedb02c852a672f4e
#. default-sha256: b2239ec002b415bf88506e9f6b3648fa0a606d9c0d10d0c3da79fbd9b3134eae
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_6F1BFE48_A06D_46EC_A469_FF0B76D4CD9B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And there appeared to be someone downstairs."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Et il semblait y avoir quelqu’un en bas."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D8545916_B613_4B5C_ABBE_B1366C67A1CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 180c2f9f2eb4f4e4f2e6dac699c7b58eb519cc367f38a34a3f3736df2b2e04cf
#. default-sha256: 41340d0bf0621e7b70c0cf0040a8aec8fb31e3719b1b369c2372a60c736e7604
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D8545916_B613_4B5C_ABBE_B1366C67A1CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Can you imagine just how delighted I was?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Pouvez-vous imaginer comme j’étais ravie ?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_69BEEF25_929F_4661_AF3C_90866F4B2E90
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6fee0c11f6dba483578b108f01847c2b7aa5f63994822fdf61944443de349eb1
#. default-sha256: ec1cc4fc6db674d6a97c9ab990be33767a4c9c970c41ee6cf86e19e53439afeb
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_69BEEF25_929F_4661_AF3C_90866F4B2E90"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Though part of me was anxious about what kind of person I might find, the "
"possibility that it could be you had my heart aflutter."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Même si une partie de moi était anxieuse et se demandait quel genre de personne "
"j’allais trouver, l’espoir que c’était peut-être vous me donnait des ailes."

#: scenario2:scenario2_6C7365BA_1923_450C_B94F_377563A07BE8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e37ddd44e224d67d04b19707c58918e4215b001c2016f5fcae7ad5e71533cbe
#. default-sha256: 2a3cff9cde1ed8bbbc6863bda94c0537aca717eb9095090b995a3630497011a0
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_6C7365BA_1923_450C_B94F_377563A07BE8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So, resisting the urge to rush, I headed for the basement."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Alors, réfrénant mon envie de courir, je me dirigeai vers le sous-sol."

#: scenario2:scenario2_CE61E984_96CF_4238_8371_127CE64F6C26
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fbe8c09f86a59a5fe5fddf9f8328002f3bc9c11c508f6047cf866a95e840f012
#. default-sha256: 1ac47c673e0101055b52588a0d3f5de04e93ed76b569487a5366f2416318b133
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_CE61E984_96CF_4238_8371_127CE64F6C26"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The cellar was where red wine, smoked meat, and other preserved foods were kept."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫On gardait à la cave le vin rouge, la viande fumée et les conserves."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A03F0CB8_6422_45D1_B7A7_7BDEE4AE1CF3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38ec3d49c8f6393592090db7c4fb262ea4445aa486bf48d43d0295fa1c714e2e
#. default-sha256: ac6168de90fe5795d2a67663e8f0cf20ddc9b12f135af9df2cee41d6cb2c4501
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A03F0CB8_6422_45D1_B7A7_7BDEE4AE1CF3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫By that point, the wine was practically antique."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫À⟪k:2⟫ ce stade, le vin était pratiquement une antiquité."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A707287C_4268_4201_AD01_8C51EBCA5674
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d8a195f9ff37875e43879e923e9ed82b805c2021379ec6cb35fca78d6b0284d9
#. default-sha256: 9057124423f21c206ae0bb78763467af81650a299bd891942243b5906d565fd6
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A707287C_4268_4201_AD01_8C51EBCA5674"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫As I had expected, a man had made his way into the cellar."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Comme je m’y attendais, un homme avait pénétré dans le cellier."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E541ED9E_4B76_4D69_BF7A_FC22D5BAE705
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6d56cfa9cd3f12248404b79b4ac19963d098f55f5ee46b6d06c899468af5fa3a
#. default-sha256: 99b7479fc5b880276dc3259dccb493235ebecd9bc525c8d88f7307417905c221
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E541ED9E_4B76_4D69_BF7A_FC22D5BAE705"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Is anyone there?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Qui est là ?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_ACB2E755_72C6_499A_9271_5E1ECBA33911
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9cd78a053de0afe73a493e47288be394930c8ac5289fa010aefc62eff1666744
#. default-sha256: ceb7a97954e3ad9b98235fd290c2dc31d816d1cb7e82fb3ee9c7a056d322535f
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_ACB2E755_72C6_499A_9271_5E1ECBA33911"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Although, I am unsure if referring to him as a “man” is entirely accurate."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Toutefois, je ne suis pas sûre qu’utiliser le terme « homme » à son sujet soit tout à fait "
"correct."

#: scenario2:scenario2_3A93706E_89F4_4CA8_9521_8C4E07974C4C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
