#: scenario2:scenario2_D0AD09AE_120B_46E6_95B8_2C114A440F45
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4726e052815145a172934e642287c831981de3e5c85d13e71c3cf014adc7350b
#. default-sha256: 8883ddc65d0b33329b41a2dd910cd92099fe506bbbd128adbf6e1dd52e915824
