#: scenario2:scenario2_202E432C_F56C_47BC_A045_5AECC8CD9F87
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea28c32a9b15e183576c2847c23e465388cc6179f82a4cf6a43dfcf317637e7b
