msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_202E432C_F56C_47BC_A045_5AECC8CD9F87"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The very first thing I sensed was an almost unbearable stench."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Mon tout premier contact prit la forme d’une puanteur presque insupportable qui envahit "
"mes narines."

#: scenario2:scenario2_29CF1136_6DBF_4845_85A3_1D0EB75DE064
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6bd7131421a1b0f46609f0f1236b2d9cb3090eb1f25fafb182f55b31453e3165
#. default-sha256: 82c5781ce0e76a248762dcaec4a1dd367bc02bd73a8769467831d34214a238eb
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_29CF1136_6DBF_4845_85A3_1D0EB75DE064"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The odor emanated from the man, heightened by the food he had carelessly rummaged through."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫L’odeur émanait de l’homme et était accrue par la nourriture qu’il avait négligemment "
"répandue."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C1CF5EED_D967_46E3_BAEA_7D481DC2FF5C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f57d41afb0e55141394e8ce7ed1bf185fa4afde513c02a4c1886075a10b21450
#. default-sha256: de3ffe871de288ff09be08d0d72a1e1421d0dc7f40d707ad116c500581ef519d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C1CF5EED_D967_46E3_BAEA_7D481DC2FF5C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Blood-red liquid spilled from wine barrels, soaking the floor."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Un liquide rouge sang coulait des tonneaux et imbibait le sol."

#: scenario2:scenario2_4791847B_28A8_437F_8D8C_3EDEA8044954
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 133c18f18e86f2a83b0d43046c7923695ae14005632ef8a06c3fb68f0388733e
#. default-sha256: 9b633aaa6bf9f8367b3ebb16e3d40f198fcc1bb7264cb0293ad6af2b8d32a4fc
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_4791847B_28A8_437F_8D8C_3EDEA8044954"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫His sunken eyes had a piercing, wolf-like glimmer in them. His teeth were sharp and "
"yellowed, visible as he ripped into a chunk of meat. He grumbled in a seemingly inhuman tongue."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ses yeux caves luisaient d’un éclat perçant et sauvage, comme un loup. Ses dents pointues et "
"jaunies arrachaient des morceaux de viande. Il grommelait dans une langue de toute évidence "
"inhumaine."

#: scenario2:scenario2_787445AC_69E8_4BEF_85E0_8BF1246C9160
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f7ae99fa69769d5c86894c2d85edb743d76b6823ec01301ff52ddf6c1bebda1b
#. default-sha256: 213d128db2ad61e65b9d6824bde2e6e3ce8c76e403b604b98457990060ca52ab
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_787445AC_69E8_4BEF_85E0_8BF1246C9160"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was looking at a beast. ⟪k:1⟫Or perhaps a half-beast."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫C’était une bête. ⟪k:1⟫Ou peut-être était-il à moitié bête."

#: scenario2:scenario2_EE2EB011_CDA1_42B1_A23F_F07DB21EC612
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8034761a936c66a914efcb23acdc96bfa45e210838438a30cf88605f11351432
#. default-sha256: d80593be32697bee177dd0727b314235db939a409cbcff12ed70b274bd7163ae
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_EE2EB011_CDA1_42B1_A23F_F07DB21EC612"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There was another source of odor in the room, though. ⟪k:1⟫It had something of a kind of "
"metallic tinge to it, and when I noticed this..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais il y avait aussi une autre odeur dans la pièce. ⟪k:1⟫Une odeur un brin métallique, et "
"lorsque j’eus compris..."

#: scenario2:scenario2_86319B00_68D9_4163_A412_19DCA6EF73B0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 28b10939fa02e24b573ffcc27f58851b6e45d03a159c44656b4f95b7d9927cf1
#. default-sha256: c93f636937a7c3607466929c2a4e50c6d1c691140fa3a375ac8201cf310290f1
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_86319B00_68D9_4163_A412_19DCA6EF73B0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I nearly passed out. ⟪k:1⟫The red liquid was not just wine, as I had assumed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...je faillis m’évanouir. ⟪k:1⟫Le liquide rouge n’était pas que du vin, comme je l’avais "
"pensé."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D3C60F28_EB03_4988_99D9_441C3CFBB376
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8644f7c6cc30327d187ac41913d4118be089066ee36251fbccdaeb6818628fd1
#. default-sha256: 0ad16e618e20ec5d3daddb474a79866236ef19c58243ad1f407972ae5264a5db
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D3C60F28_EB03_4988_99D9_441C3CFBB376"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The beast had, I presume, stolen a weapon from the village. ⟪k:1⟫A sword far too nice for "
"him lay on the floor by his side."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La bête avait, je suppose, volé une arme du village. ⟪k:1⟫Une épée bien trop belle pour lui "
"était posée au sol à côté de lui."

#: scenario2:scenario2_38461A89_9CBA_4005_AD1F_4233F9E2576D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c4e74c042e6388e49f4a22a132677f8c2bafac7cdb5437498b45bd75c324e11
#. default-sha256: 840bf49e44863e0de5c4450ccde8cd948ddbd0b2413de7a821c1a8bedd684e19
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_38461A89_9CBA_4005_AD1F_4233F9E2576D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I could hardly imagine how many people’s lives he had taken with that blade. ⟪k:1⟫It was "
"visibly wet with blood, even in the darkness of the cellar. But at the same time, it had an "
"imposing gleam."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je ne pouvais imaginer combien de vies il avait prises avec cette lame. ⟪k:1⟫On voyait "
"qu’elle était humide de sang, même dans l’obscurité de la cave. Mais en même temps, son éclat en "
"imposait."

#: scenario2:scenario2_EF164A91_D207_49DC_8E9D_0D0B1BD3C129
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 274ea0a90b470c36bed053556919490b09b8df1129e6834237d02ce750f5c928
#. default-sha256: 09e401802e79e169f259e3f533169d9b396e6fa7fcad7157b5a1b019d7968f5c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_EF164A91_D207_49DC_8E9D_0D0B1BD3C129"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The fine, luscious aroma of the wine could not mask the stench of blood and the beast."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le vin, malgré son arôme riche et appétissant, ne réussissait pas à masquer la puanteur du "
"sang et de la bête."

#: scenario2:scenario2_5F608901_79E3_4B7E_BD17_37AEED323F52
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e966072279ad7db51d92869a6258b869bd9f4a8e5b5c2e33616655eb7dbd5e61
#. default-sha256: 7eada0827ee3e6f93efb9dc904953a5f4d90400770d7692906c6e20e47aa2cb5
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_5F608901_79E3_4B7E_BD17_37AEED323F52"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Holding my breath, I took a few moments to ponder."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Je retins ma respiration et pris quelques instants pour réfléchir."

#: scenario2:scenario2_83074F67_A2B5_4144_B7B8_320B30871810
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: caa32451737b58f5e2bb26588ca42513ec70f5aab94863a6fa9d46cfecaf790d
#. default-sha256: 99b17b635bd60a7b6c1b69e5637684152483274001152a7cd1421bf391b1726b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_83074F67_A2B5_4144_B7B8_320B30871810"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ponder what? Oh, Master, you know..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Réfléchir à quoi ? Oh, Maître, vous savez..."

#: scenario2:scenario2_1EAEFECD_C07A_4E3B_8710_6CB30692A555
