#: scenario2:scenario2_1FABC048_0534_40E7_AE1B_D5E05A510E40
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce5f99915bf22f69fa52909ceec4548fbcca2f329fc91692888cba4c99e453eb
