msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hehehe... ⟪k:2⟫If you are in want of money,⟪k:3⟫you are welcome to help yourself to "
"some of the furniture."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Héhéhé... ⟪k:2⟫Si c’est de l’argent que vous voulez,⟪k:3⟫vous êtes libre de vous servir "
"et d’emporter du mobilier."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A19A649D_7D2C_46B7_9965_43957FE64E32
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 579f583f8f439b2eda1305e573f846197e17a3a920626c34cbf85c0b5d1c7f82
#. default-sha256: 3de3a533782d2f5554cb435b20fd96daba05ad96ab62c329076383f8a450eff4
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A19A649D_7D2C_46B7_9965_43957FE64E32"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And I imagine the villagers would be willing to welcome you if you dressed yourself up a bit "
"more like a person."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et je pense que les villageois seraient prêts à vous accueillir si vous vous habilliez un "
"peu plus en être humain."

#: scenario2:scenario2_9CBFA70E_BF3B_41E0_92AD_3405B8B0BB40
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b7f4e1a8a6d0465fca0e6755d82ce2da7f926e75740ddbf3905e331a479b3a8c
#. default-sha256: bb4c15d4040f30f0e4a48e135e960e2777126cf64708d6d8f5970d1de821ee12
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_9CBFA70E_BF3B_41E0_92AD_3405B8B0BB40"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Then you can trade the furniture for food and make your way to a larger town."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Vous pourrez alors échanger le mobilier contre de la nourriture et partir rejoindre une plus "
"grande ville."

#: scenario2:scenario2_09FA6E26_55EC_4C14_B749_4E1127F1A700
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c56cc2abf3cffa0aaa381ff67b00d30311a2e6ced3b453440394b38c83299fbb
#. default-sha256: da1624f2d06fcd556b60920ba562f6039abd4438e244806f72e9c61194b6bdc0
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_09FA6E26_55EC_4C14_B749_4E1127F1A700"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The wolf was able to fool the innocent little girl simply by putting on clothing, after "
"all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Le loup a réussi à duper la petite fille innocente en mettant simplement des vêtements, "
"après tout."

#: scenario2:scenario2_9A7CABD4_9FCA_4415_BCF5_165DA3437AC0
